        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Philip Henry Terzian, Derek Sherinian, William Kristol, Fred Barnes\n- Organizations: The Weekly Standard\n- Roles: journalist, Literary Editor, keyboardist\n- Topics: politics, culture\n\nFacts:\n- Philip Henry Terzian was born in 1950.\n- In 1995, William Kristol and Fred Barnes founded The Weekly Standard as a journal of politics and culture.\n- Since 2005, Philip Henry Terzian has been the Literary Editor of The Weekly Standard.\n- Philip Henry Terzian is an American journalist.\n- Derek Sherinian was born on August 25, 1966.\n- Derek Sherinian is an American keyboardist.\n- Derek Sherinian has toured and recorded for Alice Cooper, Billy Idol, Yngwie Malmsteen, Kiss, Steve Vai, and Joe Bonamassa.",
